[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2221.03, "timestamp": "00:37:01", "text": "私は何をプレイしていたのですか？ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2222.87, "timestamp": "00:37:02", "text": "再生中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2225.99, "timestamp": "00:37:05", "text": "スーパーアースとは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2229.51, "timestamp": "00:37:09", "text": "私は地球に通っています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2231.27, "timestamp": "00:37:11", "text": "ああ、私たちはこいつらを狙っているんだ。ああ、くそ。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2232.269, "timestamp": "00:37:12", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "who all are here"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2233.67, "timestamp": "00:37:13", "text": "民主主義。私は間違った銃を持っています。全て"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2235.067, "timestamp": "00:37:15", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "introduction"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2236.39, "timestamp": "00:37:16", "text": "よし、ヴィック、このドアを開けよう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2238.79, "timestamp": "00:37:18", "text": "友情の力によって。はい、私たちは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2240.23, "timestamp": "00:37:20", "text": "パワーが必要だ。どんな装備を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2243.91, "timestamp": "00:37:23", "text": "男たちは持っている？ふむ。皆さんはどんな装備を使っていますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2246.71, "timestamp": "00:37:26", "text": "持っている？私たちはふざけているんです。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2248.47, "timestamp": "00:37:28", "text": "デッドアイ。私はレバーアクションを持っています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2250.87, "timestamp": "00:37:30", "text": "ライフル。僕たちはただふざけているだけだよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2252.95, "timestamp": "00:37:32", "text": "ご心配なく。うん、心配しないで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2254.71, "timestamp": "00:37:34", "text": "私たちはこれを真剣に受け止めていない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2258.069, "timestamp": "00:37:38", "text": "私たちはただのんびりしているだけです。私たちはメタではありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2260.31, "timestamp": "00:37:40", "text": "装備設定があります。ああ、なんてことだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2261.829, "timestamp": "00:37:41", "text": "はい。そうそう。添付ファイルがあります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2263.19, "timestamp": "00:37:43", "text": "銃にアタッチメントを取り付けることができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2266.63, "timestamp": "00:37:46", "text": "今。何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2269.75, "timestamp": "00:37:49", "text": "ここではできないよね？何てことだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2273.03, "timestamp": "00:37:53", "text": "はい、そうです。わあ、たくさんの素敵なものが追加されました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2276.23, "timestamp": "00:37:56", "text": "特徴。すごくショックだった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2279.91, "timestamp": "00:37:59", "text": "DSSに新しい機能が追加されました。わあ、"}]